OL,3,GNEWSAGrass fire breaks out near
OL,4,Acampsite in Moray village
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters are tackling a grass fire
OL,7,Fnear a campsite in the Moray village of
OL,8,FHopeman.
OL,10,FSix appliances and a wildfire unit were
OL,11,Fsent to the scene after the alarm was
OL,12,Fraised at about 16:30 on Tuesday.
OL,14,FLossiemouth Community Council said
OL,15,Fthere were believed to have been some
OL,16,Fpower cuts as a result of the fire.
OL,18,FFootage shared by Fubar News showed
OL,19,Fflames and dense smoke next to a
OL,20,Fcampsite, containing campervans and
OL,21,Fcaravans.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
